# First line indent (reference/common/typography.md). Pages of 300 × 200 with margins of 20: page area of 260 × 160
# from (20, 20), which ends at y = 180. Lines of 12 (Size 10) and 5 pt per character: a word of four letters and its
# space take 25, so a line of 260 holds 10 words (245), one of 240, 9 (220), and one of 230, 9 too.
#
# The paragraphs get First line indent: 20 from a rule.
# p1 (25 words): the first line has 240 and 9 words; then 10 and 6. Three lines: 36.
# clause, a Text with a hanging indent (left Padding of 30 and First line indent: -30, 25 words): its content box
#   has 230; the first line starts at the padding edge, has 260 and 10 words; then 9 and 6. Three lines: 36.
# img (60 × 60, right margin 10) at the left, at y = 92, up to 152. p3 (20 words) runs beside it: its lines have
#   190, and the first one, 170: 7, 7 and 6 words. Three lines: 36, up to 128.
# p4 (60 words) starts at 128, still beside the box: 7 words in its first line (170) and 7 in the second (190); the
#   box ends there and the next two lines have 10 words. The page holds no more: 4 lines, 48. The rest, 26 words, is
#   broken again on page 2 at the whole width, and its first line is not indented: 10, 10 and 6. Three lines: 36.
# p5 (120 words) starts at 56 on page 2: 9 words and then 10 per line, 10 lines up to 176. The rest, 21 words, goes
#   on in page 3 with the lines it already had, none of them indented: 10, 10 and 1. Three lines: 36.
# p6 (5 words) is a new paragraph: indented again. One line.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: Paragraph
			Typography:
				First line indent: 20
		For style: clause
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 30
				Background: #EEF2F7
			Typography:
				First line indent: -30
	Section:
		Paragraph: aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: p1
		Text: aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: clause
			Style: clause
		Image: test/square.png
			Id: img
			Side: left
			Box:
				Width: 60
				Height: 60
				Margin: 0 10 0 0
		Paragraph: aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: p3
		Paragraph: aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: p4
		Paragraph: aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: p5
		Paragraph: aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: p6
